<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>RailConnect | Online Railway Reservation System</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
background:#eef4fa;
color:#222;
}

header{
position:fixed;
top:0;
width:100%;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
padding:18px 8%;
background:#003366;
z-index:999;
}

.logo{
font-size:30px;
font-weight:bold;
color:#FFD700;
}

nav a{
text-decoration:none;
color:white;
margin:0 18px;
font-weight:600;
transition:.3s;
}

nav a:hover{
color:#FFD700;
}

.btn{
padding:12px 24px;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
background:#FFD700;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
background:#f3c400;
transform:translateY(-3px);
}

.hero{
height:100vh;
background:url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1474487548417-781cb71495f3?w=1600") center/cover;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
}

.overlay{
background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);
padding:60px;
border-radius:20px;
color:white;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:58px;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
font-size:20px;
line-height:30px;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

section{
padding:90px 8%;
}

.title{
text-align:center;
font-size:42px;
margin-bottom:50px;
color:#003366;
}

.search{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
gap:20px;
}

.search input,
.search select{
padding:15px;
border:1px solid #ccc;
border-radius:8px;
font-size:16px;
}

.cards{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:25px;
}

.card{
background:white;
padding:30px;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-10px);
}

.card h2{
margin-bottom:20px;
color:#003366;
}

.card ul{
padding-left:20px;
}

.card li{
margin:10px 0;
}

.stats{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
gap:20px;
}

.stat{
background:#003366;
color:white;
padding:35px;
text-align:center;
border-radius:15px;
}

.stat h1{
font-size:48px;
color:#FFD700;
}

.contact{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
gap:40px;
}

.contact form{
background:white;
padding:30px;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
}

.contact input,
.contact textarea{
width:100%;
padding:15px;
margin:12px 0;
border:1px solid #ccc;
border-radius:8px;
}

footer{
background:#111;
color:white;
text-align:center;
padding:35px;
}

@media(max-width:900px){

nav{
display:none;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:40px;
}

.contact{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

<div class="logo">🚆 RailConnect</div>

<nav>

<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#search">Search</a>
<a href="#pnr">PNR</a>
<a href="#admin">Admin</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>

</nav>

<button class="btn">Login</button>

</header>

<div class="hero">

<div class="overlay">

<h1>Online Railway Reservation System</h1>

<p>
Search trains, check seat availability, book tickets securely,
track PNR status, print tickets, and manage reservations from anywhere.
</p>

<button class="btn">Book Journey</button>

</div>

</div>

<section>

<h1 class="title">Railway Network</h1>

<div class="stats">

<div class="stat">
<h1>2,500+</h1>
<p>Daily Trains</p>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<h1>8,000+</h1>
<p>Stations</p>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<h1>10 Lakh+</h1>
<p>Passengers Served</p>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<h1>24×7</h1>
<p>Reservation Service</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="search">

<h1 class="title">Search Trains</h1>

<div class="search">

<input type="text" placeholder="Origin Station">

<input type="text" placeholder="Destination Station">

<input type="date">

<select>
<option>Sleeper Class</option>
<option>Third AC (3A)</option>
<option>Second AC (2A)</option>
<option>First AC (1A)</option>
<option>Chair Car</option>
</select>

<button class="btn">Search Trains</button>

</div>

</section>

<section>

<h1 class="title">Reservation Services</h1>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">

<h2>👤 Passenger Portal</h2>

<ul>
<li>User Registration</li>
<li>Secure Login</li>
<li>Book Tickets</li>
<li>Select Journey Date</li>
<li>Passenger Details</li>
<li>Choose Class Type</li>
<li>Seat Availability</li>
<li>Online / Offline Payment</li>
<li>Booking History</li>
<li>Print e-Ticket</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>🎫 Ticket & PNR</h2>

<ul>
<li>Generate PNR Number</li>
<li>Booking Confirmation</li>
<li>Confirmed Status</li>
<li>RAC Status</li>
<li>Waiting List Status</li>
<li>Email Confirmation</li>
<li>Print Ticket</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>💳 Payment</h2>

<ul>
<li>UPI Payment</li>
<li>Debit Card</li>
<li>Credit Card</li>
<li>Net Banking</li>
<li>Cash Counter (Offline)</li>
<li>Payment History</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="pnr">

<h1 class="title">Check PNR Status</h1>

<div class="search">

<input type="text" placeholder="Enter 10 Digit PNR Number">

<button class="btn">Check Status</button>

</div>

</section>

<section id="admin">

<h1 class="title">Administrator Panel</h1>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">

<h2>🚄 Train Management</h2>

<ul>
<li>Add / Update Trains</li>
<li>Manage Routes</li>
<li>Seat Availability</li>
<li>Train Schedule</li>
<li>Station Information</li>
<li>Zone Management</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>📊 Reservation Management</h2>

<ul>
<li>Passenger Records</li>
<li>Fare Details</li>
<li>PNR Database</li>
<li>Journey Reports</li>
<li>Payment Records</li>
<li>Booking History</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>💰 Refund & Cancellation</h2>

<ul>
<li>Cancel Ticket</li>
<li>Refund Rules</li>
<li>Refund Percentage</li>
<li>Refund Processing</li>
<li>Cancellation History</li>
<li>Approve Refund</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section>

<h1 class="title">Cancellation & Refund Policy</h1>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">

<h2>❌ Ticket Cancellation</h2>

<p>
Passengers can cancel tickets by entering the PNR number. The cancellation request is sent to the administrator for verification.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>💸 Refund Policy</h2>

<p>
Refunds are calculated based on the reservation date, ticket fare, cancellation time, and applicable refund percentage.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>📧 Confirmation</h2>

<p>
After successful booking or cancellation, confirmation messages and payment details are sent to both the passenger and administrator.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="contact">

<h1 class="title">Contact Us</h1>

<div class="contact">

<div>

<h2>RailConnect Support</h2>

<br>

<p>📍 Chennai, Tamil Nadu</p><br>

<p>📞 +91 9876543210</p><br>

<p>📧 support@railconnect.com</p><br>

<p>🕒 Available 24×7</p>

</div>

<form>

<input type="text" placeholder="Full Name">

<input type="email" placeholder="Email">

<input type="text" placeholder="Subject">

<textarea rows="6" placeholder="Message"></textarea>

<button class="btn">Send Message</button>

</form>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<h2>🚆 RailConnect Railway Reservation System</h2>

<p style="margin-top:15px;">
Internet Programming Laboratory Project
</p>

<p style="margin-top:10px;">
© 2026 RailConnect. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

</footer>

<script>

document.querySelectorAll(".btn").forEach(button=>{

button.onclick=function(){

alert("Demo Railway Reservation Website.\nBackend functionality can be integrated using PHP, Java, JSP, Servlet, Node.js, or MySQL.");

}

});

</script>

</body>
</html>
